<title>USA: Genicom posts Q3 shr loss of $0.20.</title>
<headline>Genicom posts Q3 shr loss of $0.20.</headline>
<text>
<p>CHARGE</p>
<p>		    1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    loss     $0.20	  profit  $0.14</p>
<p> Net    loss     2,229	  profit  1,703</p>
<p> Revs		68,811		   78,506</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,968		   12,212</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    loss     $0.05	  profit  $0.38</p>
<p> Net    loss     541	    profit  4,563</p>
<p> Revs		211,503		  218,482</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,918		   11,977</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Genicom Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the third quarter 1996 included a $1.5 million one-time charge to deal with an environmental liability and a $4.2 million one-time restructuring charge. The first nine months 1996 also included a $1.5 million gain on the sale of assets and a $422,000 one-time loss to write-off refinancing costs.</p>
</text>
